A $ref to a definition the schema does not hold is refused before anything is
written, naming the property and the missing name (F8; TestRunRefusesBeforeWriting).

-- meta.json --
{"version": 1, "agentMethods": {}, "clientMethods": {}}
-- schema.json --
{"$defs": {
  "R": {"type": "object", "properties": {"m": {"$ref": "#/$defs/Missing"}}, "required": ["m"]}
}}
-- want.err --
R.properties.m
Missing
